## Interface: 16001
## Title: ItemFlow
## Notes: Loots everything at once, sells junk, repairs, buys full stacks and marks your cheapest item.
## Author: miyanko
## Version: 1.0.0
## Category: Inventory
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Bag_10
## SavedVariables: ItemFlowDB
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator
## AddonCompartmentFunc: ItemFlow_CompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: ItemFlow_CompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: ItemFlow_CompartmentLeave

# Load order is the dependency order: Config owns the saved settings, then each feature module, and Options
# builds the settings page, the slash command and the addon-menu entry on top of them.

Core\Config.lua
Core\Loot.lua
Core\Vendor.lua
Core\Buy.lua
Core\Bags.lua
UI\Options.lua
